{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/aqua-crest-residences-sobha-realty-downtown","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1310,"crm_id":"3671","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"AquaCrest Residences","slug":"aqua-crest-residences-sobha-realty-downtown","display_address":"Downtown Umm Al Quwain","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":1160000,"display_price":"1.16M","lattitude":25.17592363119,"longitude":55.323809916239,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sobha AquaCrest by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-sobha-realty/\">Sobha Realty</a> is a luxury waterfront project in Downtown Umm Al Quwain. Sobha AquaCrest by Sobha Realty is a luxury waterfront development in Downtown Umm Al Quwain. As the second residential cluster in the $20 billion coastal masterplan, it comprises five high-rise towers distinguished by wave-inspired contours, glass façades, and elegant proportions that embody Sobha Realty’s signature craftsmanship.</p><p>Sobha AquaCrest at Downtown Umm Al Quwain offers a curated collection of <strong>1 to 3-bedroom apartment</strong>s, each showcasing breathtaking sea views.<br>The Project also features marinas, parks, open-air cinemas, and leisure zones designed to promote wellbeing and community connection. Following the successful launch of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/sobha-aquamont-umm-al-quwain/\">Sobha Aquamont</a>, AquaCrest Residences are thoughtfully crafted to provide an all-inclusive coastal lifestyle.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Sobha_Aqua_Crest_Residences_at_Downtown_Umm_Al_Quwain_b9dbe6e980.jpg","hash":"Sobh